From: Mario T <mario.trzensky@cologne-intelligence.de>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:29:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add bridge MVP, mod simulator and UnrealScript mod core
 (milestone 3)

Bridge (apps/bridge, standalone mode):
- Match director: check-in with bot replacement, critical-path scheduling, map vote
  during post-game, travel with cooldown, ready check with no-show forfeit, countdown,
  live tracking, disconnect grace with forfeit, best-of series with loser pick,
  bot vs bot simulation, finish, resume from the event log after a restart
- Mod TCP server (shared-key handshake, flat JSON lines), local JSONL event store
  with optimistic concurrency, snapshot builder, CLI with console commands
- Mod simulator speaking the real protocol; 10 end-to-end scenarios

Mod (mods/ut99-tournament, not yet compiled):
- TournamentDM: token login, player/spectator roles, held ready check, countdown,
  configured bots, score/end reporting incl. sudden death, soft pause with score
  restore, travel, ini cache across map changes
- BridgeLink (TcpLink), TourneyMsg (flat JSON), TourneyMutator (!ready, !vote, ...)
- build.sh / build.ps1 and a first-test checklist

Protocol: hello.gm, match line without sd (ties always go to sudden death).

